-- src:239 | (zc) a person in Great Britain who was residing in Ukraine immediately before 1st January 2022, left Ukraine in connection with the Russian invasion which took place on 24th February 2022 and—
-- src:240 | (i) has been granted leave in accordance with immigration rules made under section 3(2) of the Immigration Act 1971; ...
-- src:241 | (ii) has a right of abode in the United Kingdom within the meaning given in section 2 of that Act or;
-- src:242 | (iii) does not require leave to enter or remain in the United Kingdom in accordance with section 3ZA of that Act;
-- src:243 | (zd) a person who was residing in Sudan before 15th April 2023, left Sudan in connection with the violence which rapidly escalated on 15th April 2023 in Khartoum and across Sudan and—
-- src:244 | (i) has been granted leave in accordance with immigration rules made under section 3(2) of the Immigration Act 1971;
-- src:245 | (ii) has a right of abode in the United Kingdom within the meaning given in section 2 of that Act; or
-- src:246 | (iii) does not require leave to enter or remain in the United Kingdom in accordance with section 3ZA of that Act;
-- src:247 | (ze) a person who was residing in Israel, the West Bank, the Gaza Strip, East Jerusalem, the Golan Heights or Lebanon immediately before 7th October 2023, who left Israel, the West Bank, the Gaza Strip, East Jerusalem, the Golan Heights or Lebanon in connection with the Hamas terrorist attack in Israel on 7th October 2023 or the violence which rapidly escalated in the region following the attack and—
-- src:248 | (i) has been granted leave in accordance with immigration rules made under section 3(2) of the Immigration Act 1971;
-- src:249 | (ii) has a right of abode in the United Kingdom within the meaning given in section 2 of that Act; or
-- src:250 | (iii) does not require leave to enter or remain in the United Kingdom in accordance with section 3ZA of that Act;
-- src:251 | (zf) a person who—
-- src:252 | (i) was residing in a country or territory outside Great Britain immediately before His Majesty’s Government—
-- src:253 | (aa) provided public information to advise British nationals to leave that country or territory, or
-- src:254 | (bb) arranged the evacuation of British nationals from that country or territory;
-- src:255 | (ii) has left that country or territory and is present in Great Britain; and
