-- src:258 | (bb) no requirement of leave to enter or remain in the United Kingdom in accordance with section 3ZA of that Act,
-- src:259 | (cc) leave to enter or remain in the United Kingdom in accordance with immigration rules made under section 3(2) of that Act, or
-- src:260 | (dd) leave on a discretionary basis outside of rules made under section 3(2) of that Act; or
